---
title: Dictionary
desc: A list of words in Bauhinian.
parent: Language
categories:
  - Lore
---
<style>
	dt {
		color: var(--text) !important;
	}
</style>
<dl>
	{% for word in dictionary %}
		<dt>{{ word.name }}</dt>
		<dd><em class="lighter-text">{{ word.pos }}</em> {{ word.def }}</dd>
	{% endfor %}
</dl>
